it will save files that are unsaved.

00:38:36.000 --> 00:38:37.000
That's actually something you can change here

00:38:37.000 --> 00:38:39.000
in the tools options.

00:38:39.000 --> 00:38:41.000
If you want to change that stuff,

00:38:41.000 --> 00:38:44.000
there's things in here that affect things like that.

00:38:44.000 --> 00:38:46.000
I don't happen to remember exactly where that one is.

00:38:46.000 --> 00:38:52.000
I think it might be in documents, but I don't know.

00:38:52.000 --> 00:38:53.000
Maybe it's in build projects.

00:38:53.000 --> 00:38:55.000
I have no idea where it is.

00:38:55.000 --> 00:38:57.000
You will have to hunt for it, my friends,

00:38:57.000 --> 00:39:00.000
because I have no idea where that actually is.

00:39:00.000 --> 00:39:04.000
But let's see.

00:39:04.000 --> 00:39:05.000
There it is.

00:39:05.000 --> 00:39:08.000
Before building, save all changes.

00:39:08.000 --> 00:39:10.000
And you can set that to other things,

00:39:10.000 --> 00:39:11.000
like don't save whatever.

00:39:11.000 --> 00:39:13.000
So that's just a customization you're liking,

00:39:13.000 --> 00:39:15.000
but you will notice that is why you didn't have

00:39:15.000 --> 00:39:21.000
before I built it. So if I hit F7 it builds the file and you will see that we have gotten some errors here.

